e — no qualifying symptoms."], ["Gut — IBS subtype classification", "Does not meet Rome IV criteria for IBS. No subtype assigned."], ["Nutrition — current diet (meals, snacks, water intake)", "Three meals with 1-2 snacks. Rice-based lunch and dinner, tea with sugar twice daily, evening bakery snack. Protein intake low."], ["Nutrition — special diets (keto, intermittent fasting)", "None currently. Has tried intermittent fasting briefly in the past without structure."], ["Nutrition — food preferences / intolerances", "Prefers non-vegetarian food; dislikes bitter gourd. No intolerances reported."], ["Activity — current workout routine (type, frequency, intensity)", "Nil structured at present. Walks approximately 20 minutes on some days."], ["Activity — limitations to locomotion", "None. Full range of movement, no joint pain or mobility restriction."], ["Activity — sedentary behaviour / screen time", "High — desk-based role, roughly 8-9 hours seated plus 2-3 hours screen time in the evening."], ["Sleep & recovery — sleep time, wake time, duration, quality, recovery", "Sleeps around 23:30, wakes 06:30, approximately 6.5-7 hours. Quality described as moderate; wakes unrefreshed 3-4 days a week."], ["Energy levels & recovery after activity", "Reports mid-afternoon energy dip and breathlessness on climbing two flights of stairs."], ["Mental health — current stressors & coping mechanisms", "Work pressure is the main stressor. Copes by watching television and occasional walks; no structured practice."], ["Mental health — history of anxiety, depression or treatment", "No history of diagnosed anxiety or depression; no psychiatric treatment."], ["Family history — chronic diseases by relative (father, mother, siblings, grandparents)", "Father — type 2 diabetes diagnosed in his 50s, on oral agents. Mother — hypothyroidism. One sibling, well. Paternal grandfather had type 2 diabetes."], ["Family history — diabetes", "Positive — father and paternal grandfather."], ["Family history —